        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B60, Maximum Security Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis maximum security single cylinder deadbolt made by Schlage will fit all standard door cutouts. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses ranging from 1-3/8 inches up to 2 inches. An ANSI Grade 1 deadbolt. Operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. Available in 12 finishes.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/double-cylinder-maximum-security-grade-1-deadbolt-schlage-b62\"><b>Schlage B62 Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/commercial-one-sided-deadbolt-with-exterior-trim-schlage-b581\"><b>Schlage B581 Commercial Grade 2 Single-Sided Deadbolt With Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/residential-one-sided-deadbolt-with-exterior-trim-schlage-b81\"><b>Schlage B81 Residential Graded Single Sided Deadbolt With Exposed Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/one-sided-deadbolt-schlage-b80\"><b>Schlage B80 One-Sided Deadbolt With No Exterior Trim</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSchlage deadbolts are bigger and stronger than they were before. They are ANSI <b>Grade 1</b>--the toughest ANSI grade available. Sturdy construction paired with innovative features that provide added control, security and peace of mind.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of Schlage B60 Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Schlage Maximum Security Deadbolts.</li>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 1 auxiliary lock.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<Li>Has an anti-pick shield around the cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder and trim.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/B60-install.pdf?v=1704262172\" target=\"new\"><b>Schlage B60 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage B60 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For 1-3/8\" to 2\" Door Thickness</li>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" and 1-1/2\" Bore Hole</li>\r\n<li>Universal deadbolt fits both 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Housing Diameter: 2.420\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: 5-pin, C Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Maximum Security Grade 1 Deadbolt, Schlage B60",
                "description": "Schlage Maximum Security Single Cylinder Deadbolt, B60 - This maximum security single cylinder deadbolt made by Schlage will fit all standard door cutouts. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses ranging from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches. An ANSI Grade 1 deadbolt. Operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. Available in 12 finishes.",
